                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5B21B6', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>「期望在 X 到 Y 之间，具体愿意结合职级和职责再沟通」</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: '100%', background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #DBEAFE', borderRadius: 12, flexDirection: 'column', overflow: 'hidden' }}>
            <Box style={{ height: 52, background: '#2563EB', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
